    "created_at": "2023-09-07T22:02:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-07T22:02:22Z",
    "body": "I don’t know why the decision to limit `button` to phrasing content was originally made, but I can’t think of any reason not to relax it. So if we end up having agreement on that, and the change is made to the spec, then I’ll happily update the validator to conform to the spec change.",
