    "created_at": "2023-09-08T13:51:49Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-08T13:51:49Z",
    "body": "also depends then on how things are exposed in the accessibility tree (and whether or not things *can* be exposed in a sensible way when that happens). such as headings, or any other structural elements, being completely stripped of their actual semantics by virtue of being wrapped in a button, just because there's no sensible way (within the constraints of the platform's accessibility APIs) to have it any other way",
